    "en": {
      "name": "Translation",
      "description": "Translation — a multi-engine translation plugin with 9 engine types: an out-of-the-box free translation service (Bilibili's publicly deployed Index-Translate model, no signup and no API key), OpenAI-compatible LLMs (DeepSeek, Qwen, Zhipu, Kimi, Ollama, vLLM, …), local CLI proxies (claude / codex / custom), DeepL, Google, Baidu, Youdao, Alibaba Cloud and Tencent Cloud; with streaming output, translate-as-you-type, engine management and translation history."
